notes.content:
NEW

+ Minimap: Shows your location and the locations of enemies.

CHANGES

+ The Advanced Spell "Elemental Shield" now deals bonus damage equal to 22% of your armor (level 3) and works with Troll's Smash;
+ The Advanced Spell "Elemental Nova" now also destroys Flying Machine bombs;
+ The Advanced Spell "Dancing Elemental Stones" now increases rotation speed based on your attack speed;
+ The Taurus Ability now destroys the Ice Boss's shield.

NEW


+ Welcome gift for new players (old players will also receive);

+ Dragon abilities are now displayed in the pause menu;

+ A gray circle is shown on the ground while you fly, indicating your current position and making it easier to dodge skills.


CHANGES


+ Pisces' ability 'Dive' now increases damage and area based on the stamina spent instead of time spent while underwater;

+ Tha advanced spell 'Nova' has been buffed: now also destroy projectiles and ice Boss shield;

+ The 'Vampiric Power' card has been changed: now, instead of stealing life equal to a percentage of your damage dealt, you restore a fixed amount of life based on the number of stacks of the card;

+ The cards 'Savagery', 'Focus', 'Strategy' and 'Apocalypse' have been removed from Common rarity, making them only obtainable from Uncommon and Rare rarities.


BALANCING


+ Scorpio Dragon has been nerfed;

+ Taurus Dragon has been buffed (5% armor dmg -> 8% armor dmg + 1% max HP dmg -> 3% max HP dmg);

+ Savagery has been nerfed: (+6 damage -> +5% damage);

+ Apocalypse has been buffed: (+6 damage -> +8% damage);

+ Lightning Zone effect has been nerfed: now when you are stunned you gain stun immunity for 1 second before you can be stunned again (preventing infinite stun);

+ The ultimates 'Tornado', 'Meteors' and 'Discharge' have been buffed: (Tornado now also attracts projectiles into its rotation, launching them away when finished. Meteors now leave damage-per-second areas on the ground at the impact location. Discharge now increases your movement speed while it lasts);

+ The epic card 'God of Destruction' has been buffed: reduces the cooldown of ultimates by 25 seconds -> 30 seconds


FIXES


+ Pisces ability stacking while pause (fixed);

+ Gross Impact icon not showing (fixed); 

+ Harder Scales 20 stacks limit (removed);

+ First wave with attributes cards instead of spells (fixed).

NEW


+ Lightning Zone;

+ Lightning Boss.

[img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43534004/5914e2083a7f476ece44ac6eaa5e34abc678c067.png"]
FIXES


+ (Fixed) Anger Fairy shoot not dealing dmg to targets sometimes;

+ (Fixed) Wind Intrisic and Aries Ability making bosses come with extremely high HP; 

+ (Fixed) Boss skill still deal dmg even when the effect desapears;

+ (Fixed) Cards bug when getting all spells at max level.


CHANGES


+ Walking move speed increased;

+ Lightning intrinsic: now needs 10 stacks to stun, but deals more dmg;

+ Intrisic skills now have a different icon color and shape;

+ Passive spells now have a limit of 3.

+ Ultimate Spell "Elemental Stones Lifting" has been improved: 
      10% armor dmg -> 10% dmg + 50% armor dmg;
+ Leaderboard bug fixed.

LEADERBOARD IMPROVED: 

+ High scores are now saved in the cloud, not locally;
+ The leaderboard now shows which dragon the player used to achieve that score;
+ The leaderboard can now be accessed at any time from the game's main menu;
+ The leaderboard has been reset.

BALANCING

+ The uncommon card "Long Blow" now has a maximum stack limit of 4;
+ When you get an ultimate by upgrading a basic attack to level 3, the ultimate already comes at maximum level, instead of coming at level 1.

Changes


+ Leaderboard reseted;

+ New spell system: now only 3 spells can be obtained (excluding the initial basic attack). The other two slots are reserved for ultimate spells;

+ New basic attack system: now basic attacks ROTATE, casting one at a time, not all at once;

[img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43534004/c588d7b59193d0261dd8c1e9294e11b683f3bd30.png"]

+ New ultimate spell system: now ultimate spells can no longer be obtained from cards. To obtain them, you must raise a basic attack to level 3:

Elemental Ball Lv 3 -> Elemental Meteors

Elemental Bolt Lv 3 -> Bring Element

Elemental Missile Lv 3 -> Corrupting Element

Elemental Chain Lv 3 -> Elemental Discharge

Elemental Blast Lv 3 -> Elemental Tornado

Fragmented Elemental Stone Lv 3 -> Raise Elemental Stones

[img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43534004/3479085f2a0b1d9932c695887f2a29b5ad026c90.png"]

+ Special effects for Cyber ​​Dragon and Duck Morph abilities.


Buff and Nerfs


+ Troll Riders' aim has been improved, and their Smash now deals fixed damage equal to 20% of your maximum health;

+ All enemies have been nerfed (less damage and less HP) to match the new basic attack rotation system;

+ Cybernetic Dragon has been nerfed: it now has a 60% chance to gain the extra card per wave;

+ Close Combat has been nerfed: it now increases by 20% instead of 50%.

+ Archers have been drastically nerfed: they no longer receive attack speed bonuses and no longer launch 3 arrows simultaneously in distant waves, reducing the "Bullet Hell" feel;
+ Troll Riders have been buffed: they are now immune to crowd control and deal much more damage;
+ Improved death system: now, when you die, information about what killed you is displayed.

CHANGES

+ Bosses start at wave 5;
+ The next two waves after the bosses are non-elemental (normal forest), allowing the player to breathe and prepare for the next elemental environment;
+ Visual and sound effects of spells have been smoothed out, reducing visual and sound pollution when casting multiple spells at once;
+ The 'Flying Machine' enemy has been adjusted (it can no longer be pushed by the player and throws bombs in the player's direction).

+ New epic card by stacking 4 'CLOSE COMBAT';
+ Now player and enemies blink when taking damage, improving the damage feeling;
+ Damage texts above characters last for less time, reducing visual clutter;
+ Advanced Spell 'ELEMENTAL FORM' has been improved: now the base speed during the form has increased significantly, and in addition, the speed increases even more if the spell is used with the same element as the current environment.

CHANGES

+ ICE INTRINSIC PASSIVE: Now the shards are also launched at random enemies, dealing 2% dmg, each. Deals double dmg if the target is frozen. This change allows the player to make an ice build focused on damage now.
+ ANGER FAIRY: Now she attacks random enemies.

EXTRA EFFECTS FOR SOME DRAGONS ABILITIES

+ LIBRA DRAGON: now also gives 1 extra POWER card or 1 extra HARDER SCALES card every time you get one of these;
+ TAURUS DRAGON: now also gives 1 armor every time you take damage (+400) (resets every wave);
+ CANCER DRAGON: now also heals full stamina and 50% of your HP when your health drops below 15%, once per wave;
+ GEMINI DRAGON: now also gives 1 random fairy card every time you defeat a boss.

These dragons retain their previous abilities, but with these additional effects.

BALANCING

+ Rare 'HARDER SCALES' cards now give +80 armor instead of +60;
+ ARIES DRAGON now has a maximum limit of +300%.

NEW
+ New Common, Uncommon and Rare Card: "FOCUS";

+ New Epic Card by stacking 10 "STRATEGY";

+ New Epic Card by stacking 4 "IMPOSING WINGS";
CHANGES
+ The game has been optimized, reducing the amount of enemy particles;

+ Changes to the in-game interface, with a more optimized and organized space;

+ Spells icons with different colors to distinguish basic, advanced and ultimate spells;

+ Card stacks are now shown at the top of the screen during gameplay;

+ Passive spells are now shown at the bottom of the screen;

+ Other stacks are now shown in the right corner of the screen.

[img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43534004/c3db645bc08d1ffd06e9ad014f5dcf4d8316004b.png"]

+ Now you descend much faster when pressing SHIFT.

[img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43534004/f872414bad90a36fe6cd1ba5fa1655b482c75ea9.png"]

+ The advanced spell "Wave" (and all morphs: Fire Wave, Ice Wave, Dark Wave, Lightning Wave, Wind Wave, Earth Wave) has been completely changed to "Vortex", which now deals damage per second for 5 seconds.

CHANGES

+ Collision with trees removed;
+ Issue with abrupt stop at the end of the dash fixed;
+ Stamina cost for flying has been reduced;
+ Stamina recovery while on the ground has been increased;
+ You can now land on rocks.

NEW CARDS

We bring 4 new legendary cards:


THICK LEATHER

CONDITION: Stack 12 "Harder Scales" (Armor);

EFFECT: 20% chance to block attacks.

LETHAL IMPACT

CONDITION: Stack 15 "Empowered Attack" (Critical Chance);

EFFECT: +100% Critical Damage.

FATAL HEMORRHAGE

CONDITION: Stack 4 "Chronic Wounds" (Bleeding);

EFFECT: Enemies die instantly when health drops below 15%.

HEART EATER

CONDITION: Stack 8 "Strong Heart" (HP);

EFFECT: Gain +1 max HP for each enemy you eliminate.



[img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43534004/10b60fd75747da92c8f45a030e1bc6e96d68e439.png"]


CHANGES


The "Strong Heart" card now gives double health. The uncommon card gives +400 and the rare card gives +800;

Elemental dragons have been buffed and now start with the element's intrinsic passive at maximum level;

The Griffin Morph has also been buffed, now receiving +200 HP per wave;

The Duck Morph has been nerfed, receiving only double the amount of common cards;

The Gemini Dragon now starts with 2 random fairies;

The Fear Fairy has returned to being a rare card and can be stacked up to 4 times;

The Fear Fairy no longer gains stacks when taking damage. Now she only gains stacks per second, reducing the maximum stacks until explosion by 5 for each "Fear Fairy" card stacked;

Enemies have been nerfed and now increase in strength (damage and HP) only every 5 waves, not every 1 wave.

The intrinsic passive of fire (Ignite) has been nerfed, aiming to keep up with the significant increase in player health with the new adjustments.

+ Bug fixes;
+ Shadow fixes;
+ Adjustments to the lighting of the scene and boss abilities;
+ Adjustments to the balance of humans in more distant waves.

NEW SKILL SYSTEM

The old system of equipping skills in slots was replaced by a new system, more faithful to the roguelite genre, which consists of obtaining random skills during the game, which do not remain after death.

ELEMENTAL ASPECTS

All skills gained aspects for each element, considerably increasing the options (example: The tornado can be chosen as a fire, ice, darkness, lightning, wind or earth tornado. This applies to all skills in the game) . When choosing an elemental dragon form in the home menu, all skills in the game will have that elemental aspect.

NEW CONTROLS

The old movement and skill controls have been changed. Now, the dragon's movement is performed in A, W, S, D and its abilities are used in J, K, L, U, I, O. Additionally, ultimate abilities are now cast instantly, without the need to charge .

BUGS FIXES

Several bugs were fixed, including the bug where survival against fatal damage from elemental forms did not work.

REMOVAL OF CARDS

Swiftness and Ultimate Fury cards have been removed from the game.

BUFFS, NERFS AND CHANGES

 *The SKELETAL DRAGON form has been improved;
 *The FROST BEAM skill and its aspects have been improved;
 *The ICE WAVE skill and its aspects have undergone changes;
 *The FREEZING SCALES skill and its aspects have undergone changes;
 *DISCHARGE skill has been improved;
 *The STATIC SHOCK passive has been improved;
 *The INTELLIGENCE, FAST SHOOTING and HARDER SCALES cards have been improved;
 *Now only 8 FAST SHOOTING cards can be obtained;
 *Now only 1 FEAR FAIRY card can be obtained;
 *Now the dragon will have an initial basic health regeneration, even without any cards
 CICATRIZATION.

* Environment Blasts now appear only on boss waves;
* Changed the user interface (Skills tab in the main menu);
* Additional magic effect around the dragon when charging ultimate;
* Arrival of elemental Morphs;
* Can now be Morphed: Fireball, Frost Beam, Lightning Chain and Tornado.

* Added Environment Blasts;
* Meteor Summoning Fixed;
* Projectiles increase forward speed as attack speed increases;
* Nerfed Rage Bar;
* Small fixes.

* New rage bar system;
* New cards: FRAGMENTATION, MAGNETIC SKIN and SHORT TEMPER;
* Visual improvements;
* Small fixes.

